{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"The style layer’s predicate.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSPredicate","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"filter"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"property in the style JSON."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the “"},{"type":"text","text":"Predicates and Expressions"},{"type":"text","text":"”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose "},{"code":"index","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute is 5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"or 10 and whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ele"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCompoundPredicate"},{"text":" along t